### Configuración de Variables Globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ==========================================
### 1. MÓDULO DE AUTENTICACIÓN (AUTH)
### ==========================================

### Generar JWT con las credenciales del .env
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### ==========================================
### 2. MÓDULO DE SAGAS (SAGAS)
### ==========================================

### Listar todas las sagas con paginación y búsqueda (GET /)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sagas?search=Anillos&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Obtener una saga por ID (GET /:id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sagas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Crear una nueva saga (POST /)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sagas/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "El Señor de los Anillos",
  "description": "Saga épica de fantasía escrita por J.R.R. Tolkien."
}

###

### Actualizar una saga parcialmente (PUT /:id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/sagas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Saga épica de fantasía ambientada en la Tierra Media."
}

###

### Eliminar una saga por ID (DELETE /:id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sagas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}